      "normalized ell3 eigenvalues and3+4 cluster gap",
      "cotangent eigenvalues versus round-sphere ell(ell+1)"
    ],
    "boundary": "This diagnoses a declared screen operator. It does not prove a continuum operator limit, rule out other OPH source geometries, or identify physical curvature.",
